d-tome.lua","source":"Money is the heart of the Dwarven Empire; it rules over all other considerations.\n\t\tIncreases Physical, Mental and Spell Saves based on the amount of gold you possess.\n\t\t+1 save every %d gold, up to +%d. (currently +%d)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"金钱是矮人帝国的命脉，凌驾于一切其他考量之上。\n\t\t根据你持有的金币数量提高物理、精神和法术豁免。\n\t\t每 %d 金币使豁免提高 1 点，最多 +%d（当前 +%d）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9d829f28b9e4986d2dfa3754687b379c899681d93258dce726ebeab26f0a4584","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e3982f66fa5693db735d4229e350fbb1af0f1139e9158d44248fd9ee6fec810","logical_entry_identity":"3fc9bc0a98ca902b905a33f34703bb2986db8ab723fb814a56182b2cfdd6f302","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A thick steel gorget designed to protect its wearer from fatal attacks to the neck.  This particular gorget was worn by the Halfling General Daneth Tendermourn during the pyre wars, and judging by the marks along its surface may have saved the General's life on more than one occasion.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个厚重的钢护喉，旨在保护其穿着者颈部免受致命攻击。这个特殊的护喉是半身人将军丹纳斯·坦德莫恩在烈火战争中佩戴过的，上面的各种伤痕表明其可能救过这位将军不止一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"46656f619e4888e50a984a99f3f6afbbb8a69152acfb3ffa9cdf04ef2cd06396","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e40051f9066c9c9b80f78d53fdf35232a7ed2215fda9d2f61b8b0ad785cbfb6","logical_entry_identity":"5dccecb99248f9035c32ad5d8153b92185157aea1424a14db739bcada437dd24","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Give order to character 6","source_tag":"_t","target":"发布指令：角色6"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6dd07f67dbf06049545c58ae8f1b3239efa20ac240cafc889e3ea09d5b49b97e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e428ecb6304774d65679bfc37d0880a64e1da6fe02c18e679fc550e04b4801e","logical_entry_identity":"1534015bb580839c317c8f543f189225fc93d2d164e273ee00309138b4932939","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#Weakdamage mode ON","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#弱伤害模式：开启"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator